From 13c78b6ea884db7c3b4cca7d181460755cadcc94 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Maxime=20M=C3=A9r=C3=A9?= <maxime.mere@foss.st.com>
Date: Fri, 17 Jul 2026 15:52:39 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: crypto: stm32-hash: add post-init-providers
 property
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The STM32MP15 SCMI device trees set post-init-providers on the HASH
node to defer clock/reset provider initialization until after the
device has been configured. This property is currently rejected by
the schema since additionalProperties is false and the property was
not declared, e.g.:

  hash@54002000 (st,stm32f756-hash): 'post-init-providers' does not
  match any of the regexes: '^pinctrl-[0-9]+$'

Declare post-init-providers so dtbs_check no longer flags it.

Change-Id: I7aa57b038d89ba92a576f4f8cd241a9c1b447199
Signed-off-by: Maxime Méré <maxime.mere@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/linux-stm32/+/589193
Reviewed-by: Yann GAUTIER <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
Domain-Review: Yann GAUTIER <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/crypto/st,stm32-hash.yaml | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/crypto/st,stm32-hash.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/crypto/st,stm32-hash.yaml
index 822318414095..e86bc0bc9238 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/crypto/st,stm32-hash.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/crypto/st,stm32-hash.yaml
@@ -51,6 +51,8 @@ properties:
   power-domains:
     maxItems: 1
 
+  post-init-providers: true
+
   access-controllers:
     minItems: 1
     maxItems: 2
-- 
2.53.0

